docs {
  # Admin List DataShare SIMs

  Returns all MTN datashare SIMs with live stock and usage summaries.

  Optional filters:

  ```txt
  status=active|paused|retired
  groupName=Group A
  phoneNumber=2348160424228
  ```

  ## Endpoint

  ```txt
  GET /api/v1/admin/services/data/datashare/sims
  ```

  ## Success Response

  ```json
  {
    "sims": [
      {
        "id": "sim_id",
        "phoneNumber": "2348160424228",
        "label": "SIM A1",
        "groupName": "Group A",
        "activeFromDay": 1,
        "activeToDay": 10,
        "dailyLimitMb": 5120,
        "dailyLimit": "5GB",
        "todaySharedMb": 1024,
        "todayShared": "1GB",
        "todayShareCount": 1,
        "dailyRemainingMb": 4096,
        "dailyRemaining": "4GB",
        "dailyLimitReached": false,
        "monthlyShareLimit": 10,
        "monthShareCount": 4,
        "monthlyRemainingShareSlots": 6,
        "monthlyLimitReached": false,
        "monthSharedMb": 4096,
        "monthShared": "4GB",
        "remainingMb": 10240,
        "remaining": "10GB",
        "simBalanceMb": 4506,
        "simBalance": "4.4GB",
        "lastProviderReportedAt": "2026-08-30T13:34:26.000Z",
        "totalMb": 15360,
        "total": "15GB",
        "soldMb": 5120,
        "sold": "5GB",
        "revenue": 2000,
        "costSpent": 1000,
        "profit": 1000,
        "defaultReloadMb": 11264,
        "defaultReloadData": "11GB",
        "defaultReloadCost": 3500,
        "defaultReloadValidity": "30Days",
        "defaultReloadExpiresAfterDays": 30,
        "canQuickReload": true,
        "status": "active",
        "note": "",
        "createdAt": "2026-08-30T12:00:00.000Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-30T12:00:00.000Z"
      }
    ],
    "count": 1
  }
  ```

  ## Frontend Notes

  Show two balances clearly:

  - `remaining`: BillXpress internal stock remaining.
  - `simBalance`: latest balance 2Fast/MTN reported after a vend.

  Show limits as progress values:

  - daily data used: `todaySharedMb / dailyLimitMb`;
  - monthly slots used: `monthShareCount / monthlyShareLimit`;
  - remaining monthly slots: `monthlyRemainingShareSlots`.
}
